{"event":"changes_requested","job_id":"docs-payment-methods-pix","reason":"Full independent review of all 118 pinned raw lines with matching SHA-256. Candidate and suggestions match the accepted receipt; all five quotes are exact at their stated lines. Pix identity, QR flow, Brazil local-entity condition, transfer versus daily merchant settlement, matrix/note tension, transaction checks, and routes are accurately retained. One material dispute-flow error remains: the candidate describes Adyen auto-defense followed by InformationSupplied as a progression, whereas raw line 67 distinguishes evidence of suspicious behavior (auto-defense) from no such evidence (close RFI, send information to the bank, change status to InformationSupplied and send webhook). The fixed Q2 answer should keep that branch distinction when describing dispute outcomes."}
