{"event":"changes_requested","job_id":"docs-payment-methods-pix-android-drop-in","reason":"Full independent review of all 1,127 pinned raw lines with matching SHA-256. Candidate and suggestions match the accepted receipt; all five quotes are exact at their stated lines. The flow/version split, Pix fields, QR/Pending outcome, historical expiry dates, asynchronous test promotion and live request are accurately scoped. Two material implementation-example conflicts remain unflagged: both Android submit-button Kotlin snippets at raw lines 519\u2013526 and 573\u2013581 contain an unlabeled nested block rather than a named Pix configuration block, so they are not copy-ready; and raw line 591 describes required paymentMethod as state.data.paymentMethod from a front-end onSubmit event, which is not reconciled with this Android Drop-in guide. A reader asking how to configure the button or supply the Advanced payment method could otherwise treat those examples as an Android contract."}
