{"event":"changes_requested","job_id":"docs-payment-methods-pix-flutter-component","reason":"Full independent review of the 1,092-line pinned raw with matching SHA. The five quotes, Sessions/Advanced field and version limits, QR/Pending finality, dated examples, refund/test/live qualifications, mismatched Drop-in prerequisite links, and reciprocal concept route are supported. One material Flutter handoff conflict remains underqualified: the candidate repeats raw Pix line 556's `state.data.paymentMethod` wording as the front-end source for required `/payments.paymentMethod`. The captured Flutter Components Advanced base guide says `onSubmit` returns `data` and describes `/payments.paymentMethod` as the complete `payload` from that event (advanced-flow raw lines 22256\u201322269 and 22332\u201322341). Saying only that the Pix child does not demonstrate a Flutter callback leaves the misleading property path in the retained answer. Q2 asks for base-guide conflicts but omits this one."}
